<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00874">
	<title>Recommended cold tire inflation pressures</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25G009_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>All specifications (sizes and pressures) can be found on a label attached to the driver’s side center pillar.</p>
		<note type="tip">
			<p>All tire pressures (including the spare) should be checked when the tires are cold. “Cold Tires” means the vehicle has not been driven for at least three hours or driven less than 1.6 km (1 mile).</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>